{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"The net balance point does that: it compares the payments made and the remaining payment balances, and then subtracts the cost of the point upfront.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"mortgage-points-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"es","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"mortgage-points-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["mortgage-points-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"es","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"El punto de equilibrio neto lo hace: compara los pagos realizados y los saldos de pago restantes, y luego resta el costo del punto por adelantado.","record_id":"776677c00efc559b70117b42d724d3d79bcb831c0a7dc2758ee507b8c5c17b30","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.2972103456249968,"source":"The net break-even does: it compares payments made and remaining payoff balances, then subtracts the upfront point cost. The separate payment-only break-even uses monthly payment reduction alone.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"ec452281db5e034b8e0a85efaa74a6fd87226d29cccc82a019f64189ce7f508c","status":"machine-draft","translation":"El punto de equilibrio neto lo hace: compara los pagos realizados y los saldos de pago restantes, y luego resta el costo del punto por adelantado.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
